*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!testbench
!testbench/**
testbench/**/__pycache__
# S-I6: the answer key is ground truth for the scorer and tests only (testbench/README.md), not
# something the deployed, publicly-reachable container should carry on disk. The import-linter
# answer-key-isolation contract only keeps selector_drift from importing it in Python; it says
# nothing about what ships inside the image's filesystem, so it is re-excluded here explicitly,
# after the `!testbench/**` re-include above. The portal (testbench.portal) never imports it.
testbench/answers/
